  94:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****             ##### Initialization and Configuration functions #####
  95:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****  ===============================================================================
  96:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     [..]
  97:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     This subsection provides a set of functions allowing to initialize the USARTx or the UARTy
  98:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     in asynchronous mode.
  99:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****       (+) For the asynchronous mode the parameters below can be configured:
 100:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) Baud Rate
 101:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) Word Length
 102:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) Stop Bit
 103:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) Parity: If the parity is enabled, then the MSB bit of the data written
 104:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****              in the data register is transmitted but is changed by the parity bit.
 105:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) Hardware flow control
 106:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) Receiver/transmitter modes
 107:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) Over Sampling Method
 108:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) One-Bit Sampling Method
 109:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****       (+) For the asynchronous mode, the following advanced features can be configured as well:
 110:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) TX and/or RX pin level inversion
 111:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) data logical level inversion
 112:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) RX and TX pins swap
 113:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) RX overrun detection disabling
 114:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) DMA disabling on RX error
 115:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) MSB first on communication line
 116:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) auto Baud rate detection
 117:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     [..]
 118:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     The HAL_RS485Ex_Init() API follows the UART RS485 mode configuration
 119:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****      procedures (details for the procedures are available in reference manual).
 120:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c **** 
 121:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c **** @endverbatim
 122:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c **** 
 123:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   Depending on the frame length defined by the M1 and M0 bits (7-bit,
 124:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   8-bit or 9-bit), the possible UART formats are listed in the
 125:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   following table.
 126:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c **** 
 127:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     Table 1. UART frame format.
 128:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     +-----------------------------------------------------------------------+
 129:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |  M1 bit |  M0 bit |  PCE bit  |             UART frame                |
 130:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |---------|---------|-----------|---------------------------------------|
 131:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |    0    |    0    |    0      |    | SB |    8 bit data   | STB |     |
 132:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |---------|---------|-----------|---------------------------------------|
 133:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |    0    |    0    |    1      |    | SB | 7 bit data | PB | STB |     |
 134:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |---------|---------|-----------|---------------------------------------|
 135:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |    0    |    1    |    0      |    | SB |    9 bit data   | STB |     |
 136:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |---------|---------|-----------|---------------------------------------|
 137:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |    0    |    1    |    1      |    | SB | 8 bit data | PB | STB |     |
 138:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |---------|---------|-----------|---------------------------------------|
